import pathlib,re,hashlib
exec(pathlib.Path(__file__).with_name('common.py').read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
reviews=load('docs/editorial/news-reviews.json');news=[]
def article(k,slug,z,e,d,de,pairs,sources,review):
 paras=[('背景與發展','Background and developments',*pairs[0])]+[('','',*p) for p in pairs[1:]]
 paras.append(('資料與報導方法','Sources and reporting method',review.pop('method'),review.pop('methodEn')))
 a=write(k,slug,z,e,d,de,paras,sources,extra=dict(tags=[k,'education','2026'],topic={'ca':'canada','kr':'asia','uk':'uk'}[k]))
 raw=re.split(r'^---\s*$',(R/a['publishedPath']).read_text(encoding='utf8'),flags=re.M)[2]
 review.update(bodySha256=hashlib.sha256(raw.encode()).hexdigest(),reviewedAt=NOW,primarySource=sources[0][1],independentSource=sources[1][1])
 reviews[slug]=review;news.append(a)
article('ca','canada-student-arrivals-target-2029-extension','加拿大將每年15萬新留學生抵達目標延至2029年：穩定訊號與招生落差','Canada extends its 150,000 new student arrivals target to 2029: stability meets a recruitment gap','11月5日移民計畫延長規劃期，並非增加每年名額；教育團體歡迎可預測性，也提醒實際抵達尚未達標。','The November 5 plan extends the planning horizon without raising the annual target. Education groups welcome predictability while warning that actual arrivals lag.',[
('加拿大11月5日公布2027至2029年移民規劃，將每年最多15萬名新國際學生抵達的目標延伸到2029年。對已經受多次政策調整影響的學校，新消息是規劃時間拉長，而不是年度數量突然增加。The PIE News於11月6日報導指出，2027與2028年原有數字維持不變；因此不能把三年總計誤寫成一次新增的招生名額。','Canada’s November 5 immigration plan extends a target of up to 150,000 new international student arrivals annually through 2029. For institutions affected by repeated policy changes, the development is a longer planning horizon, rather than a sudden annual increase. The PIE News reported on November 6 that the existing figures for 2027 and 2028 remain unchanged. A three-year total should not be described as a one-off expansion of available places.'),
('加拿大移民部原文把學生放在新臨時居民抵達的框架裡：每年37萬人包含22萬名工作者與最多15萬名學生。另列每年38萬名永久居民接納目標，當中包含已在加拿大工作或就學的人。這些是不同身分與統計項目，不能將永久居民數字加到留學生人數，也不能用總量推算台灣學生能分到多少錄取機會。','IRCC places students within an annual target of 370,000 new temporary resident arrivals, comprising 220,000 workers and up to 150,000 students. A separate permanent resident admissions target includes people already studying or working in Canada. These categories measure different statuses and events. Permanent admissions cannot be added to the student figure, and national totals cannot establish a Taiwanese applicant’s chance of admission.'),
('政策延續的背景，是政府一面希望教育機構吸引人才，一面控制人口增加對住房與公共服務的壓力。官方將可預測的總量與地方勞動需求並列，顯示招生政策仍被放在更大的移民與公共資源安排中。對學校而言，多一年規劃期有助於安排課程與招生；但其價值仍取決於後續執行是否一致，不能只從公告用語判斷市場已經恢復。','The government frames international education alongside housing, services and regional labour needs. Recruitment therefore remains part of a wider population and resource policy. Our analysis is that a longer horizon can help institutions plan courses and recruitment, but its practical value depends on consistent implementation. The language of an announcement alone cannot establish that demand or confidence has recovered.'),
('教育界的回應也呈現這個落差。The PIE引述加拿大國際教育局負責人Larissa Bezo，歡迎穩定目標為機構規劃帶來空間，同時提醒2026年最新資料顯示，實際表現距目前目標仍有距離。本文未取得同口徑的完整年度抵達數，因而不補算缺口百分比；團體的警訊應理解為對落實能力的關切，而非另一項新配額。','The PIE cites Canadian Bureau for International Education president Larissa Bezo welcoming predictability while warning that current arrivals remain below the existing target. We did not obtain a complete annual arrivals series on a matching basis and therefore do not calculate a shortfall percentage. Her warning concerns implementation, not a second quota or a measured admission rate.'),
('Universities Canada亦在報導中支持延續目標，強調穩定政策與重建國際信心的關係。兩個組織都是教育機構的代表，能提供學校端觀點，但不能取代學生實際申請結果。把官方希望達到的規模、業界期待及最後抵達的人數分開，才能看出政策是否只是更容易規劃，還是真的改善申請者的就學路徑。','Universities Canada also supports continuity, linking predictable policy to rebuilding confidence. Both organisations represent education institutions; their perspectives do not substitute for applicant outcomes. Separating the government’s intended scale, sector expectations and eventual arrivals is necessary to assess whether the policy merely improves planning or also improves students’ experience.'),
('對台灣家庭最直接的解讀，是不要將「目標維持」看成「個人申請保證」。學生收到學校錄取、完成所需許可程序與實際入境，是不同步驟。國家總量無法回答某校某課程是否仍招生、文件是否齊全或何時能成行。編輯建議把每一步的正式通知與期限分開保存，避免只靠一張新聞截圖，就作出不可退費的住宿或交通安排。','For Taiwanese families, continuity in a national target is not an individual guarantee. Admission, required permission and arrival are separate steps. An aggregate cannot establish whether a particular course has places, whether documents are complete or when travel is possible. Our practical recommendation is to retain formal decisions and deadlines for each stage, rather than make non-refundable commitments from a news headline.'),
('研究所申請者尤其要分清總量新聞與自己適用的規則。移民部另外維持研究生資訊入口，區分申請許可、生活安排與畢業後工作等事項；這些入口的條件與更新時間，仍須逐頁核對。本次2029年延長公告不能替代個別學位與學校資格的判定，也沒有自動把所有碩博士申請人改成同一種快速或免文件程序。','Graduate applicants also need to distinguish aggregate policy from their own route. IRCC maintains separate information on permits, graduate life and work after study, each with conditions to check. Extending the target to 2029 does not determine the eligibility of a degree or institution and does not place every graduate applicant into an identical expedited or document-exempt process.'),
('下一個值得追蹤的不是再加總三年數字，而是相同定義下的實際抵達、各地落實安排與學校招生變化。若出現新的課程或許可細則，應以其生效日期更新個人計畫。就目前證據，這次消息可確認的是年度目標延續與規劃期延長；無法確認的是台灣申請者未來的成功率、特定學校的名額，以及政策會否消除所有申請延誤。','The next meaningful evidence is actual arrivals measured consistently, implementation across regions and institutional recruitment changes. Families should update plans when applicable course or permit rules take effect. Current evidence establishes continuity and a longer horizon. It does not establish future success rates for Taiwanese applicants, places at a particular institution or the disappearance of processing delays.')],
[('IRCC — November 5 levels-plan backgrounder','https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/11/building-a-stronger-canada-through-a-well-managed-predictable-immigration-system.html'),('The PIE News — independent November 6 sector reporting','https://thepienews.com/canada-extends-150000-international-student-arrivals-target-to-2029/'),('IRCC — graduate-study information routes','https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/study-canada/graduate-student.html')],
dict(newsValue='11月5日新計畫將15萬新學生抵達目標延伸至2029，區別既有2027及2028目標，具體新進展可追溯。',background='說明臨時居民總量與教育、住房、公共服務之間的政策脈絡，不把總人口目標誤當各校招生額。',development='分清學生與工作者新抵達及永久居民接納不同統計，沒有把三年累計宣稱為新增名額。',perspectives='納入CBIE對實際抵達低於目標的警訊及Universities Canada回應，註明均為機構代表觀點。',taiwanImpact='針對台灣家庭分開錄取、許可與旅行安排，指出全國目標不能換算個人成功率或特定課程餘額。',uncertainty='未取得完整同口徑年度抵達數，不推算缺口百分比；沒有宣稱總量穩定保證快速審核。',independence='IRCC提供政策原文；PIE署名記者比較前後計畫並報導兩教育團體回應，非單純政府稿轉載。',method='實讀IRCC 11月5日原文、PIE 11月6日報導及研究生入口。未另做採訪；家庭規劃段落為編輯分析。國會資料照不是當日記者會。',methodEn='We read IRCC’s November 5 backgrounder, The PIE’s November 6 report and the graduate-study gateway. No new interviews were conducted. Family planning sections are editorial analysis. The Parliament archive photograph is not the announcement event.'))
article('kr','korea-regional-national-universities-tuition-plan-2027','韓國地方國立大學2027免學費方案：招生競爭將如何改變？','Korea’s 2027 regional national university tuition plan raises recruitment questions','30所地方國立大學新生補助逐年擴展；11月6日評論提醒注意私校與國際招生的連鎖效應，台灣學生不能直接套用本國生資助。','Support at 30 regional national universities would expand by cohort. A November 6 analysis raises questions for private institutions and international recruitment; Taiwanese applicants cannot assume domestic funding applies.',[
('韓國計畫從2027年起，為30所地方國立大學新入學學生提供全額學費支持，並逐年擴及其他年級。這項地方高教政策在11月6日再次引發國際教育討論：The PIE的Voices專欄作者Kyuseok Kim指出，降低本國學生就讀國立大學的價格，也可能改變附近私立大學招收國際學生的動機。這是前瞻分析，尚非政策已造成招生轉移的實證結果。','Korea plans full tuition support for incoming students at 30 regional national universities from 2027, expanding by cohort. On November 6, Kyuseok Kim’s Voices commentary in The PIE examined how a domestic price change might affect international recruitment at nearby private institutions. This is prospective analysis, not evidence that the policy has already shifted enrolment.'),
('韓國獎學金財團現行說明列出適用學校與年級：2027年先從一年級開始，至2030年擴至一到四年級；轉學生另列2029年以後的範圍。校單包含釜山大學等地方國立大學，但排除首都圈國立、公立及部分依特別法設立的學校。醫學、牙醫、韓醫、藥學與獸醫等科系也不在這項範圍內，不能簡化成「韓國大學全部免學費」。','KOSAF’s current page starts with first-year students in 2027 and expands to years one through four by 2030; transfer eligibility begins separately from 2029. The list includes Pusan National University, while excluding national institutions in the capital region, public municipal institutions and certain special-law universities. Medicine, dentistry, Korean medicine, pharmacy and veterinary medicine are excluded. This is not universal free university tuition.'),
('公告把方案放在國家獎學金整合申請之下，並保留後續學業進度與重複資助等審查。全額學費這四個字只描述資助範圍，並不表示住宿、生活與交通費都由政府負擔。本文亦未將2026年度其他獎項的申請日期移植到2027新方案；正式申請時程與個案資格仍要依當梯次公告確認，不能從政策方向直接推導自己今天可送件。','The programme sits within the integrated national scholarship application system and retains progression and duplicate-funding checks. Full tuition describes the supported expense, not housing, living or travel costs. We do not transfer another award’s 2026 application dates to this 2027 scheme. Applicants need the relevant cycle’s timetable and individual eligibility rules before treating an announcement as an open application.'),
('對外國學生而言，國籍界線尤其重要。財團一般國家獎學金說明明列韓國國籍要求，而PIE評論所討論的受益對象也是韓國新生。這些證據不支持把方案列為台灣學生的新獎學金。若另有校級國際生減免，必須查其獨立條款與錄取通知；同一所大學同時有不同資助制度，不能因校名相同就把本國生待遇移到國際生帳單。','Nationality is critical for overseas readers. KOSAF’s general national scholarship information specifies Korean nationality, and the PIE analysis concerns incoming Korean students. This does not support listing the scheme as a new Taiwanese scholarship. Any institutional international award requires its own terms and offer. Multiple funding systems at the same university do not make domestic benefits transferable to international fee accounts.'),
('Kim提出的主要問題是，政策能否讓學生從首都圈走向地方，還是主要讓原本就在地方的學生改選國立校。兩種結果對區域發展的意義不同：前者可能增加地方的人才流動，後者則可能改變既有學校之間的生源分配。作者並未證明其中一種結果必然發生，本文因此保留「可能」的表述，不把分析模型寫成已完成的招生統計。','Kim asks whether the policy draws students away from the capital region or mainly shifts existing regional enrolment from private to national institutions. These are different outcomes for regional development. He does not demonstrate that either is inevitable. We therefore retain conditional language rather than present an analytical scenario as an observed recruitment statistic.'),
('這個問題與國際教育的交會點，是私校在本國生變少時會如何調整。評論提醒，若國際招生擴張快於語言教學、住宿及學業支持能力，就可能增加學生承擔的風險。但不能反過來認定所有地方私校都品質不佳，或所有招收外國學生的計畫都出於財務壓力。判斷一所學校，仍需要它自己的課程、人員配置與學生服務證據。','The international education connection is how private institutions respond if domestic enrolment falls. The commentary warns about recruitment growing faster than language teaching, housing and academic support. It does not establish that all regional private universities have poor quality or that every international initiative is financially driven. Institutional judgements require evidence about the particular programme, staffing and services.'),
('本刊的編輯分析是，台灣學生比較韓國學校時，可以把招生承諾轉成具體可核對的問題。例如課程實際授課語言、需要達到的韓語程度、能否取得足夠必修學分，以及住宿安排由誰確認。這些問題不是因為某校已被證實有缺失，而是用來避免把較低費用當成唯一選校依據；一筆學費減免仍需放回完整學習計畫裡評估。','Our editorial analysis is to translate recruitment promises into verifiable questions: the actual teaching language, required Korean proficiency, availability of compulsory credits and responsibility for housing confirmation. These questions do not imply documented failings at a particular institution. They help prevent a discount from becoming the sole selection criterion and place price within a complete study plan.'),
('家庭也應將新聞中的「區域發展」與畢業後個人工作安排分開。地方大學的資助政策，本身不能證明當地有適合某專業的職缺，更不等於國際學生取得留用承諾。若學校強調產學合作，宜進一步核對合作內容是否與自己的學位和年級相關，而不是只看合作企業名單。這是對資料範圍的提醒，並非預測學生一定找不到工作。','Families should also distinguish regional development policy from an individual graduate’s employment plan. A funding scheme does not establish the availability of suitable jobs or a retention commitment for an international student. Industry partnerships should be checked for relevance to the intended degree and cohort, rather than assessed through company names alone. This is a limitation of the evidence, not a prediction of unemployment.'),
('接下來應觀察的是正式預算與執行細則、國立與私立學校的實際招生變化，以及國際生支持資源是否同步調整。現在可確認的，是官方已列出方案範圍及逐年擴展設計；尚未能確認的，是政策對地方人口、私校財務或台灣學生選校結果的效果。保留這條界線，才能報導制度變化，同時不把尚待驗證的可能性當成既成事實。','The next evidence should cover budget implementation, detailed rules, actual enrolment changes and international support capacity. The official page establishes scope and a phased design. It does not establish effects on regional population, private-sector finances or Taiwanese students’ choices. Keeping that boundary allows policy reporting without turning untested possibilities into facts.')],
[('KOSAF — regional national university tuition programme','https://www.kosaf.go.kr/ko/scholar.do?pg=scholarship05_12_19'),('The PIE Voices — Kyuseok Kim analysis, November 6','https://thepienews.com/south-koreas-free-tuition-plan-could-reshape-international-student-recruitment/'),('KOSAF — general national scholarship nationality rules','https://www.kosaf.go.kr/ko/scholar.do?naviParam=JH,02,02,05&pg=scholarship05_12_01_01')],
dict(newsValue='以11月6日教育評論追蹤2027地方高教方案，提供國際招生角度而非將舊公告冒充當日公布。',background='交代國立與私立、首都圈與地方招生選擇問題，將學費資助與區域發展目標明確區分。',development='核對官方30校與逐年擴展及醫藥等排除，沒有把2026其他獎項截止搬到新年度。',perspectives='明示Kim是IES Abroad主管撰寫Voices評論，提供獨立分析而非新聞採訪或已證明的影響。',taiwanImpact='台灣學生不能將韓國本國生制度當國際獎學金；提出授課語言、學分與住宿的具體選校核對。',uncertainty='不斷言私校一定招生流失或國際生必定擴張；預算執行與結果仍待後續實證資料。',independence='KOSAF原文確立規則；PIE具署名專欄提出區域私校競爭及學生支持問題，分析獨立於財團公告。',method='實讀KOSAF兩種獎項規則及PIE署名評論；韓文以翻譯輔助理解，未使用逐字引語或新增採訪。本文為政策追蹤分析，圖片是釜山大學資料照。',methodEn='We read KOSAF’s programme and general nationality rules and the signed PIE commentary. Translation assisted interpretation of Korean; no verbatim quotations or new interviews are used. This is follow-up policy analysis with an archive photograph of Pusan National University.'))
article('uk','scotland-college-infrastructure-investment-plan-2026','蘇格蘭學院十年校舍需求估25億英鎊：維修與轉型如何取捨','Scotland estimates £2.5 billion in college infrastructure needs over a decade','SFC新計畫量化24所學院的校舍壓力；金額是策略估算，並非已核定的建設預算。','A new SFC plan quantifies estate pressures across 24 colleges. The figure is a strategic estimate, not an approved construction budget.',[
('蘇格蘭資助委員會11月公布學院基礎設施投資計畫，估計2027/28至2036/37財政年度的需求約25億英鎊。The Scotsman於11月4日報導這份計畫及教育界、政府回應，將老舊校舍問題帶進預算討論。對準備赴英就學的家庭，值得注意的不是「英國大學獲得新補助」這種概括說法，而是報告涵蓋哪些機構、估算與撥款究竟差在哪裡。','The Scottish Funding Council’s November infrastructure plan estimates roughly £2.5 billion in needs for financial years 2027/28 to 2036/37. The Scotsman’s November 4 report brings together the plan, sector reaction and a government response. For families considering UK study, the issue is which institutions are covered and how an estimate differs from approved funding, rather than a generic claim that British universities received a new grant.'),
('官方計畫涵蓋24所學院、99個校區與270個建築區塊，將約13億英鎊歸於維持及管理校舍狀況，另約12億英鎊用於轉型項目。原文特別指出，這是包含標準成本調整的策略規劃估算，不是一次提出或已經到位的撥款。它描述目前校舍組合在特定情境下的需求，不能解讀為每所學校已經分得相同比例的建設經費。','The plan covers 24 colleges, 99 campuses and 270 building blocks, with approximately £1.3 billion for maintenance and estate condition and £1.2 billion for transformation. SFC explicitly describes a strategic planning estimate with standard cost adjustments, not an approved allocation. It models needs for the current estate; it does not award each institution a proportional share.'),
('這些需求也不限於漏水或修補外牆。官方框架將實體空間、數位環境與減碳調適放在一起考量，並比較投資、維持、合作與處分等方向。換言之，問題不是原有每棟建築都照原樣保留，而是未來教學需要哪些空間、哪些服務可協作。計畫仍須配合可取得的資本與日常資源，不能只談新建築而忽略後續使用與維護。','The framework combines physical infrastructure, digital provision and climate adaptation, considering investment, maintenance, collaboration and disposal. The question is which spaces future teaching requires and where services can be shared, rather than preserving every building unchanged. Delivery depends on available capital and operating resources, including the continuing cost of using and maintaining facilities.'),
('學院代表團體Colleges Scotland在媒體報導中要求加快投資，指出平盤經費可能僅夠處理緊急事項。這是代表學院爭取資源的立場，應與官方估算一併閱讀，而不能當成所有項目必須立即全數核准的結論。先處理安全與必要維修、同時評估長期教學模式，可能有不同的排序；新聞中的總額本身無法回答每項工程應先後如何安排。','Colleges Scotland calls for faster investment and warns that flat funding may cover little beyond urgent work. This is a sector advocacy position, not proof that every project should receive immediate approval. Safety, essential repairs and long-term teaching needs may require different priorities. A headline total cannot determine the sequence of individual projects.'),
('The Scotsman亦取得高等教育部長Alyn Smith回應，政府認為學院體系需要重大轉型，並提及當年度核心經費增加。核心經費與校舍資本支出不是同一科目，所以不能用核心預算增加直接宣布修繕缺口已補足。媒體同時呈現政府與學院的不同著眼點，讓爭論從單一總額進一步轉向：增加資源、調整校舍與改變服務方式，應如何一起安排。','The Scotsman also reports minister Alyn Smith’s response emphasising sector transformation and an increase in core funding. Core operating support and estate capital expenditure are different categories, so a rise in one does not demonstrate that repair needs are fully funded. The competing emphasis is on how resources, estate changes and service redesign should fit together.'),
('獨立審計提供另一層背景。Audit Scotland在9月10日的年度報告指出，學院於2024/25年度面臨更大的財務壓力，更多機構依賴資助委員會預支現金；學生人數、註冊數與全時當量也連續兩年下降。三種指標定義不同：一名學生可以註冊多個課程，全時當量則折算學習量，不能混用來誇大某一所學校流失了多少學生。','Audit Scotland’s September 10 annual report adds an independent financial context: growing strain in 2024/25, greater reliance on cash advances and two consecutive years of decline in headcount, enrolments and full-time equivalents. These measures differ. A student can register for multiple courses, while FTE converts study volume. Mixing them would distort claims about student loss.'),
('審計的全體趨勢也不能直接轉成個別學校即將停辦的預告。本刊的編輯分析是，基礎設施與財務壓力值得納入選校，但應回到所申請課程的實際場地、設備與支援安排。若課程涉及工作坊、實驗室或專業訓練空間，學生可向學校確認使用地點與規劃中的變動，而不應單憑漂亮建築照片或全國性投資數字判斷教學條件。','Sector-wide audit findings do not predict the closure of a particular college. Our editorial analysis is to examine facilities and finance through the intended course’s actual location, equipment and support. Applicants to workshop, laboratory or professional training programmes can ask about access and planned changes, rather than judge teaching conditions from attractive photographs or national investment totals.'),
('台灣學生亦須避免把蘇格蘭college與英國所有university混為一談。這份投資計畫有明確的機構範圍，並不替每個學位課程、轉學銜接或國際招生資格作認證。實務上應記下授課機構、學位授予機構與所在校區，再讀正式課程頁。若宣傳提到新設施，還要分清已啟用、施工中與尚待經費的計畫，才知道自己入學時能使用什麼。','Taiwanese applicants should distinguish Scotland’s colleges from the entire UK university sector. This plan does not certify every degree, articulation route or international admissions arrangement. Record the teaching institution, awarding body and campus, then check the formal course description. Distinguish operating facilities, construction and projects still awaiting funding when assessing what will be available during the intended intake.'),
('下一個關鍵是預算決定與各校後續計畫能否對上這份需求評估，而不是把25億英鎊反覆當成已發生的投資。本文未取得每所學院逐年獲配金額，也未實地檢查建築安全；因此不對個別校園作安全評級。新報告的價值在於建立可討論、可追蹤的基準，讓修繕與轉型選擇接受檢驗，尚不能替代工程核准、執行與完成驗收。','The next test is whether budget decisions and institutional plans respond to the assessment. We have not obtained annual allocations for every college or inspected building safety, and do not assign campus safety ratings. The report supplies a baseline for scrutiny of maintenance and transformation choices. It does not replace project approval, execution or completion checks.')],
[('SFC — College Infrastructure Investment Plan 2027/28–2036/37','https://www.sfc.ac.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/College-Infrastructure-Investment-Plan-2027-28-to-2036-37_Download.pdf'),('The Scotsman — November 4 reporting and ministerial response','https://www.scotsman.com/education/colleges-will-need-ps25bn-to-maintain-campuses-suitable-for-teaching-9328550'),('Audit Scotland — September 10 independent annual audit','https://audit.scot/publications/scotlands-colleges-2026'),('SFC — plan context and delivery framework','https://www.sfc.ac.uk/estates-infrastructure/college-infrastructure-strategy-baseline-2024/college-infrastructure-investment-plan-2027-28-to-2036-37/')],
dict(newsValue='11月新十年校舍需求計畫及11月4日媒體政府回應，與學生學習環境及資源配置有直接關聯。',background='以9月Audit Scotland獨立審計呈現現金與學生量背景，區分headcount、enrolments及FTE口徑。',development='核對24校99校區270blocks、25億估算及13億與12億組成，明示是策略估算非已核定經費。',perspectives='呈現Colleges Scotland資源訴求與部長轉型回應，不將代表團體主張當政府已承諾的撥款。',taiwanImpact='協助台灣學生分清college與university及授課、授予、校區三項，關注可使用設施而非照片。',uncertainty='不對個別學院停辦或建築安全作無證推論，未取得各校逐年撥款與現場檢查，明確揭露。',independence='SFC原計畫與Scotsman具署名報導交叉核對，後者增加政府回應；Audit Scotland另提供獨立審計證據。',method='實讀SFC計畫摘要及實施入口、Scotsman報導與Audit Scotland年度頁。未做現場採訪或安全檢驗。圖片為Dundee Gardyne校區資料照，不代表新建工程。',methodEn='We read the SFC plan summary and delivery page, The Scotsman’s report and Audit Scotland’s annual page. No field interviews or safety inspections were conducted. The Dundee Gardyne archive photograph does not depict a newly funded project.'))
